sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client_App/Extension
    participant S as Server

    C->>S: GET /get-parameters
    S-->>C: 200 {P, G}

    Note over C: Compute  secret_y locally from client_id + password
    C->>S: POST /register {client_id, secret_y}

    alt New client_id
        S-->>C: 201 {client_id}
    else Existing client_id
        S-->>C: 200 {client_id} (public value updated)
    else Invalid payload or subgroup value
        S-->>C: 400/422 {reason}
    end

    Note over S: Each  response includes tracing and security headers
